# Boosted Sloop's "Whenever you attack, draw a card, then discard a card" (CR 603.2, 508.1) belongs to its controller and needs only that
# the controller attacked, not the Vehicle: Bot2 casts the Sloop and a Savannah Lions on turn 2. Bot1's own turn-3 attack with its Lions
# makes Bot2 loot nothing (its graveyard stays empty). On turn 4 Bot2 attacks with the Lions alone, the Sloop uncrewed and at home,
# and loots: it draws the Swamp and discards the Island.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Savannah Lions
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Boosted Sloop
Savannah Lions
Island
Forest
Mountain
Swamp
Island x9

